# Shared Player Shell — Catalog-Wide Mobile Delta Plan

The Awtsmoos gives thirty different game worlds one common doorway without flattening their play;
Awtsmoos.com should make that doorway fully touchable, bounded, and responsive in the same quiet way.

## Proven containment

The shared shell is mounted across 30 top-level games. Live opened-menu measurements on the Adventure route prove:

390×844:
- horizontal overflow: 0;
- launcher: 46×46 at x=332..378;
- open panel: x=82..378, width 296;
- no shell control crosses a side edge.

320×568:
- horizontal overflow: 0;
- launcher: 46×46 at x=262..308;
- open panel: x=12..308, width 296;
- no shell control crosses a side edge.

Therefore panel sizing and fixed positioning are already working and must not be redesigned.

## Proven interaction defects

On both phone probes:
- close button is only 36×36;
- menu actions are 42px high;
- the current coarse-pointer media rule intends larger targets, but headless mobile emulation does not match it, proving target safety should not rely solely on pointer classification;
- hover brightness is applied unconditionally, including touch-oriented browsers;
- no explicit pressed state exists;
- focus-visible and reduced-motion contracts already exist and must be preserved.

## Exact rewrite

Rewrite only `games/styles/player-shell/responsive.css` completely.

Preserve:
- focus-visible outline;
- expanded-launcher feedback;
- coarse-pointer safe-area positioning and 50px launcher;
- <=520px panel width/padding and one-column action layout;
- reduced motion;
- increased-contrast borders.

Improve:
- give shell buttons/links a short filter/transform transition;
- scope hover to `(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine)`;
- add universal `:active` pressed transform/filter;
- at `max-width:520px`, guarantee actions and close are at least 46px high independent of pointer media support;
- guarantee close is 46×46 on phone;
- preserve coarse-pointer 46px sizing as an additional contract;
- neutralize transforms under reduced motion.

## Verification

Run both player-shell tests. Reopen the shell at 390×844 and 320×568. Require overflowX 0, panel fully inside viewport, close >=46×46, visible actions >=46px high, launcher >=46×46, no side-escaped controls, and source <=120 lines with no long lines.
